@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:3001

### List projects
GET {{baseUrl}}/projects

### Add a project (change the path to a real FEATURES.md)
# @name addProject
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "PM Tool",
  "featuresPath": "C:/CHANDAN S S/Claude Workspace/Claude Code/pm-tool/FEATURES.md"
}

### Edit the project just added
PUT {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{addProject.response.body.id}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "PM Tool (renamed)",
  "featuresPath": "C:/CHANDAN S S/Claude Workspace/Claude Code/pm-tool/FEATURES.md"
}

### Remove the project just added
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/projects/{{addProject.response.body.id}}

### Failure: a path that does not exist returns 422
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "Ghost", "featuresPath": "C:/does/not/exist.md" }

### Failure: empty name and path return 400 with field errors
POST {{baseUrl}}/projects
Content-Type: application/json

{ "name": "", "featuresPath": "" }

### Failure: unknown id returns 404
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/projects/unknown-id
